<Layout title="About TrekkersQuest"><section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</span><h1>More context for the call of the outdoors.</h1><p>TrekkersQuest is an India-only trekking discovery platform designed to help people explore trails, understand preparation and ask better questions before they go.</p></section><section class="section"><h2>Discover with care</h2><p>We believe useful trail discovery is about more than a beautiful view. People deserve clear information about what is known, what needs confirmation and how to prepare responsibly.</p><h2>Built for curious feet</h2><p>From first-time hikers to experienced walkers, our goal is to make Indian outdoor landscapes easier to explore—without pretending to operate trips or verify information we have not checked.</p><p class="notice">TrekkersQuest is a demo brand in this build. No company history, operator credentials or live services are claimed.</p></section></Layout>
